  "details": "When trying to create Group only instance, it gives you a 403 error when doing so. Even with the correct permissions.\n\n`{\"error\":{\"message\":\"You're not allowed to create this group instance․\",\"status_code\":403}}`\n\nPermissions for my role is on the attached image\n\nSteps: \n\n- Visit a world page\n\n- Create Instance\n\n- Select \"Group\" (I used default permissions with queue)\n\n- Click Create Instance\n\n- See 403 in Networking/Console tab\n\nHAR file sent to Squid\n\nJust to note, I am able to create Group instance in-game.",
